//! Chat Service — thin orchestrator for the chat mode pipeline.
//!
//! Coordinates: store message -> build context -> call LLM -> store response
//! -> broadcast event -> return.
//!
//! Chat ask-mode now delegates work through the agentic runtime when available.
//! The old chat-local tool registry path has been removed; legacy tool proposal
//! records may still be rendered from history, but new chat turns do not create
//! them directly.

