    /// `resolver.registry_for_scope(principal, workspace)?` per call so
    /// procedure skills (whatsapp, jq, awk, gmail, browser, …) loaded
    /// per-scope from `<scope>/skills/` and `<system>/skills/` are
    /// reachable. The autonomous outer loop already does this through
    /// `executor.rs::execute_action`; chat needed the same plumbing to
    /// stop hitting "not registered in CapabilityRegistry" on every
    /// non-embedded pack call.
